{"base_rate":0.2880116959064328,"brier":0.32670190058479526,"bss":-0.5931940545554983,"bss_hi":-0.3752433524505305,"bss_lo":-0.8395314528050404,"chart":{"base":[311.0,386.0],"fp":[171.1,34.0],"lead":"62,278.6 272,276.6 482,274.3 692,259.8","note":{"base":"skill -0.59 — higher than 2% of cities","fp":"low end -3pp, high end +46pp","lead":"day-1 error 0.8 °C — better than 90% of cities","rel":"promised 16% → rained 5%; promised 99% → rained 60%"},"rel":"164.5,443.8 381.9,376.3 508.5,375.4 611.8,319.7 686.2,205.7"},"country":"BJ","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.3659502923976608,"ess":415.8358833112207,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Cotonou</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Cotonou rain forecast is cannot beat its own climatology, though 8 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>60%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(5%), there is still roughly a <b>1%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 684 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-03-25. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nthe station, 3.9 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score -0.59, ranked 211 of\n216 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(207&ndash;214) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>5%</td><td class='num'><b>1%</b></td><td class='num'>68</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>28%</td><td class='num'><b>9%</b></td><td class='num'>68</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>45%</td><td class='num'><b>13%</b></td><td class='num'>67</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>57%</td><td class='num'><b>29%</b></td><td class='num'>63</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>67%</td><td class='num'><b>22%</b></td><td class='num'>65</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>74%</td><td class='num'><b>21%</b></td><td class='num'>78</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>84%</td><td class='num'><b>30%</b></td><td class='num'>69</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>92%</td><td class='num'><b>38%</b></td><td class='num'>55</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>60%</b></td><td class='num'>151</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">8 of 9 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Cotonou</b> <span class=\"muted\">Benin</span></p>\n  <div class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag bad\">Cannot beat climatology</span><details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What does this label mean?\" title=\"What does this label mean?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>Compared with a simple guess: saying &ldquo;29% chance of rain&rdquo; every day, because it rains here on 29% of days.</p><p>The forecast did worse than that guess.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details>\n    <span class=\"muted\">8 points off by more than chance</span></div>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score<details class=\"ginfo\"><summary aria-label=\"What is the skill score?\" title=\"What is the skill score?\">?</summary><div class=\"ginfo-pop\" role=\"note\"><p>How much better the forecast is than that simple guess. 0 means no better, 1 means perfect, below 0 means worse. Day-ahead rain forecasts usually score 0.3 to 0.5.</p><p><a href=\"#bss\">How the skill score works</a></p></div></details></dt><dd>-0.59</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>207&ndash;214\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 216</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>684 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Cotonou &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Cotonou\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"75.54382352941177,344.52941176470586 155.61029411764707,242.82352941176472 216.6131343283582,175.55223880597015 260.2857142857143,127.7777777777778 293.764,102.0 321.5030769230769,74.0 353.71826086956526,49.6521739130435 383.486909090909,24.618181818181824 408.74132450331126,18.0 408.74132450331126,27.642384105960275 383.486909090909,77.56363636363636 353.71826086956526,112.95652173913044 321.5030769230769,148.66666666666666 293.764,180.39999999999998 260.2857142857143,220.22222222222223 216.6131343283582,262.4776119402985 155.61029411764707,317.7647058823529 75.54382352941177,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"277.1637426900585\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"277.1637426900585\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"75.54382352941177,376.6470588235294 155.61029411764707,349.88235294117646 216.6131343283582,333.1044776119403 260.2857142857143,278.0 293.764,303.6 321.5030769230769,307.33333333333337 353.71826086956526,271.2173913043478 383.486909090909,243.0181818181818 408.74132450331126,162.63576158940398\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 5%&amp;#10;It rained 1% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"75.54382352941177\" cy=\"376.6470588235294\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 28%&amp;#10;It rained 9% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 68 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"155.61029411764707\" cy=\"349.88235294117646\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 45%&amp;#10;It rained 13% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 67 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"216.6131343283582\" cy=\"333.1044776119403\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 57%&amp;#10;It rained 29% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 63 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"260.2857142857143\" cy=\"278.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 67%&amp;#10;It rained 22% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 65 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"293.764\" cy=\"303.6\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 74%&amp;#10;It rained 21% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"321.5030769230769\" cy=\"307.33333333333337\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 84%&amp;#10;It rained 30% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 69 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"353.71826086956526\" cy=\"271.2173913043478\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 92%&amp;#10;It rained 38% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 55 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"383.486909090909\" cy=\"243.0181818181818\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 60% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 151 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"408.74132450331126\" cy=\"162.63576158940398\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(29%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Cotonou the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>summer</b> (-0.47) and least in\n<b>winter</b> (-2.58).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>173</td><td class='num'>8%</td><td class='num'>-2.584</td><td class='num'>37.8%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>152</td><td class='num'>29%</td><td class='num'>-0.645</td><td class='num'>34.5%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>181</td><td class='num'>38%</td><td class='num'>-0.484</td><td class='num'>37.4%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>178</td><td class='num'>40%</td><td class='num'>-0.474</td><td class='num'>36.3%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":6.36536,"lon":2.41833,"n":684,"n_cities":216,"name":"Cotonou","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.16,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.049558823529411766,"n":68,"obs":0.014705882352941176,"sig":false},{"hi":0.39,"lo":0.16,"mean":0.27573529411764713,"n":68,"obs":0.08823529411764706,"sig":true},{"hi":0.53,"lo":0.39,"mean":0.4480597014925373,"n":67,"obs":0.13432835820895522,"sig":true},{"hi":0.63,"lo":0.53,"mean":0.5714285714285714,"n":63,"obs":0.2857142857142857,"sig":true},{"hi":0.71,"lo":0.63,"mean":0.6660000000000001,"n":65,"obs":0.2153846153846154,"sig":true},{"hi":0.79,"lo":0.71,"mean":0.7443589743589742,"n":78,"obs":0.20512820512820512,"sig":true},{"hi":0.89,"lo":0.79,"mean":0.8353623188405798,"n":69,"obs":0.30434782608695654,"sig":true},{"hi":0.96,"lo":0.89,"mean":0.9194545454545453,"n":55,"obs":0.38181818181818183,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.96,"mean":0.990794701986755,"n":151,"obs":0.6026490066225165,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":3.9,"provisional":false,"rank":211,"rank_hi":214.0,"rank_lo":207.0,"reliability":0.1581765858348174,"resolution":0.03758129764082181,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"cotonou","station":"","timezone":"Africa/Porto-Novo"}